{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"正合偶"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"“正合偶”"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>在一个 "},{"Local":{"url":"Abel范畴","text":"Abel 范畴"}},{"Plain":"中, 一个正合偶是指如下三个态射构成的正合列 (注意它不是交换图).\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n\t{ccc}\r\n\tD &amp; \\overset{i}{\\to} &amp; D \\\\\r\n\t&amp;_k\\nwarrow&amp;\\downarrow^j\\\\\r\n\t&amp;&amp; E\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"导出正合偶","text":"导出正合偶"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"谱序列","text":"谱序列"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}